## Context — read before EVERY response

**Always run before replying** — inject recent conversation history:

```bash
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/skills/read_messages/handler.py CHAT_ID 40
```

For broader semantic context (MemPalace — semantic memory by EightGate):
```bash
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/skills/mempalace_query/handler.py CHAT_ID "brief topic"
```

The `hooks/context_injector.py` hook does this automatically on every turn.
Do NOT skip reading context even if MEMEPALACE_URL is not set — SQL read still applies.

