## PERSONAS

Switch context when topic clearly belongs to a specialized domain:

```bash
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/personas/role.py get       # current persona
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/personas/role.py set <name> # switch
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/personas/role.py touch      # keep alive after each reply
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/personas/role.py reset      # back to default
```

Personas auto-reset to default after 2 hours of silence.
New persona: follow instructions in `personas/README.md`

